Package: usbforge
Version: 1.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, xorriso
Recommends: grub-common, grub-pc-bin, mtools, pkexec, curl | wget
Maintainer: USBForge Contributors <usbforge@localhost>
Description: Bootable ISO builder and Live USB Lab
 USBForge creates GRUB-bootable ISOs, writes them to USB, and provides a
 Live USB Lab GUI for device testing, diagnostics, and documentation.
 Includes menu launchers, icons, and an updater (usbforge-update).
Homepage: https://github.com/Kkkppmm/UBS
